            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

The unit in which the data values are measured, expressed as a controlled-vocabulary entry (RepresentedVariable.describedUnitOfMeasure). For a plain-string unit, use cdif:simpleUnitOfMeasure instead.</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifInstanceVariable.InstanceVariable.describedUnitOfMeasure"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
